    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "A. smaragdinus is endemic to the Bahamas."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Habitat",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "A. smaragdinus is found in a variety of habitats, including forest, shrubland, and introduced vegetation."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Diet",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
